{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34314","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 八 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"强起披衣坐，徐行处暑天。\n上阶来鬬雀，移树去惊蝉。\n莫问盐车骏，谁看酱瓿玄。\n黄金如可化，相近买云泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}